cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the
  original WiFiAnalyzer listed under references.
type: software
title: "WiFiAnalyzer (modified version): Wi-Fi scan, connection, location and Wi-Fi RTT logging to CSV"
abstract: >-
  A modified version of WiFiAnalyzer 3.3.1, an open-source Android Wi-Fi
  analyzer. It records the current connection, every scanned BSSID, the
  device location and Wi-Fi RTT (IEEE 802.11mc/802.11az) distance
  measurements over time into CSV files.
authors:
